# Never let line-ending or encoding normalisation near a binary file. One pass
# of text conversion replaces every byte that is not valid UTF-8 with U+FFFD
# and destroys the file's compressed streams, which for a PDF means a document
# that still opens and shows nothing. tests/assets.test.ts checks for exactly
# that damage; this stops git being the thing that causes it.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.tar.gz binary
